    "detailed_description": "<strong>Urban Explorer is a first-person exploration game with elements of parkour and puzzles.</strong> <br>Follow the footsteps of the masters, evade security, and remember the golden rule: take only photos, leave only footprints! Your photographs can earn recognition within the community and place you at the top of the leaderboard.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Utilize special equipment such as a flashlight, camera, and gas mask. Your parkour skills, outsmarting guards, and gear will allow you to safely access forbidden areas. Worried about what you'll encounter on your journey? Choose the difficulty level that suits you best.<br><br><strong>TAKE PICTURES</strong><br>The photographs you take can earn recognition within the community and place you at the top of the leaderboard. Stay true to the #1 Urbex rule &quot;take only pictures, leave only footprints behind&quot; and capture places lost in time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>USE YOUR EQUIPMENT</strong><br>Utilize special equipment such as a flashlight, camera, and gas mask. Use lockpicks to enter restricted areas. Your parkour skills, outsmarting guards, and gear will allow you to safely access forbidden areas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PREPARE YOURSELF</strong><br>Before going on a mission, you\u2019ll be able to study intel available on the facility to get to know the threats that could await you. You can also choose the difficulty level that suits you best. Remember to equip yourself properly and you will get back safely.<br><br><strong>USE PARKOUR SKILLS</strong><br>You\u2019ll often have to use your parkour abilities to avoid security or access areas that, at first glance, seem inaccessible. Couple this with the appropriate equipment and there\u2019s no place you can\u2019t slip in!<br><br><strong>CHALLENGES</strong><br>Thanks to the day and night system, the ability to revisit locations, new challenges and fresh clues you'll uncover will provide you with the opportunity to thoroughly explore the maps' mysteries. <br><br>If you love exploration and post-apo theme is your jam \u2013 you\u2019ll find all of this in Urban Explorer.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Urban Explorer is a first-person exploration game with elements of parkour and puzzles.</strong> <br>Follow the footsteps of the masters, evade security, and remember the golden rule: take only photos, leave only footprints! Your photographs can earn recognition within the community and place you at the top of the leaderboard.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/57b9fd09da3ec18f5fee6dd8806de8dc.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Utilize special equipment such as a flashlight, camera, and gas mask. Your parkour skills, outsmarting guards, and gear will allow you to safely access forbidden areas. Worried about what you'll encounter on your journey? Choose the difficulty level that suits you best.<br><br><strong>TAKE PICTURES</strong><br>The photographs you take can earn recognition within the community and place you at the top of the leaderboard. Stay true to the #1 Urbex rule &quot;take only pictures, leave only footprints behind&quot; and capture places lost in time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/78f8c892f824c380ba25ed57d37128aa.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>USE YOUR EQUIPMENT</strong><br>Utilize special equipment such as a flashlight, camera, and gas mask. Use lockpicks to enter restricted areas. Your parkour skills, outsmarting guards, and gear will allow you to safely access forbidden areas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.poster.avif?t=1724158156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.webm?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111840/extras/5f60a895ea3ae5f6fc8726c057a71be7.mp4?t=1724158156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PREPARE YOURSELF</strong><br>Before going on a mission, you\u2019ll be able to study intel available on the facility to get to know the threats that could await you. You can also choose the difficulty level that suits you best. Remember to equip yourself properly and you will get back safely.<br><br><strong>USE PARKOUR SKILLS</strong><br>You\u2019ll often have to use your parkour abilities to avoid security or access areas that, at first glance, seem inaccessible. Couple this with the appropriate equipment and there\u2019s no place you can\u2019t slip in!<br><br><strong>CHALLENGES</strong><br>Thanks to the day and night system, the ability to revisit locations, new challenges and fresh clues you'll uncover will provide you with the opportunity to thoroughly explore the maps' mysteries. <br><br>If you love exploration and post-apo theme is your jam \u2013 you\u2019ll find all of this in Urban Explorer.",
